00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Not just one practical application point for today's message, but for all four weeks of the Digital Detox series. And to do that, I want to review where we've been throughout this series.

23
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:03,000
It's summertime, so some of you have missed some of the weeks, and that's okay. But I want to make sure we're kind of tracking along with where we've been.

