51
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:30,000
And yet, they refused to allow that invitation to be there. They stepped across that boundary, and they chose to take from the tree.

52
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:37,000
And that decision began forming them not into the image of the Creator, but into the image of creation.

53
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:47,000
